      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BAD KNEES (8) got around 515m in a good 29.73 when winning a Grade 4/5 at this track last start. Can measure up again if runs up to latest time. DAISY'S CHARM (1) finds it hard to break through. Finished third (23.14) at this track last time making it three minors on end. Has performed well from this box with a win and six minor placings to her name from 11 starts. Well placed and gets her chance. IT'S A TEASE (4) was a strong winner (22.54) from box 1 last time, scoring by 2.75 lengths at Maitland. Will need some luck early after drawing a tricky box here. Must be included in calculations. MRS. MINIVER (2) scored last time and can measure up again.",
